{"number":79,"nameUz":"Nazi'at","nameCyr":"Назиот","nameArabic":"النَّازِعَاتِ","nameEnglish":"An-Naazi'aat","englishNameTranslation":"Those who drag forth","revelation":"Makkiy","ayahCount":46,"ayahs":[{"number":5713,"numberInSurah":1,"text":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلنَّٰزِعَٰتِ غَرْقًۭا","translation":{"latin":"Shiddat bilan (jonni) sugʻurib oluvchi(farishta)lar bilan qasam.","cyrillic":"Шиддат билан (жонни) суғуриб олувчи(фаришта)лар билан қасам."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5713.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5713.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5714,"numberInSurah":2,"text":"وَٱلنَّٰشِطَٰتِ نَشْطًۭا","translation":{"latin":"Yumshoqlik bilan jon oluvchi(farishta)lar bilan qasam.","cyrillic":"Юмшоқлик билан жон олувчи(фаришта)лар билан қасам."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5714.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5714.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5715,"numberInSurah":3,"text":"وَٱلسَّٰبِحَٰتِ سَبْحًۭا","translation":{"latin":"Suzib yuruvchi(farishta)lar bilan qasam.","cyrillic":"Сузиб юрувчи(фаришта)лар билан қасам."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5715.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5715.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5716,"numberInSurah":4,"text":"فَٱلسَّٰبِقَٰتِ سَبْقًۭا","translation":{"latin":"Oʻzishda musobaqa qiluvchi(farishta)lar bilan qasam.","cyrillic":"Ўзишда мусобақа қилувчи(фаришта)лар билан қасам."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5716.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5716.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5717,"numberInSurah":5,"text":"فَٱلْمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمْرًۭا","translation":{"latin":"Amrning tadbirini qiluvchi(farishta)lar bilan qasam.","cyrillic":"Амрнинг тадбирини қилувчи(фаришта)лар билан қасам."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5717.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5717.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5718,"numberInSurah":6,"text":"يَوْمَ تَرْجُفُ ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ","translation":{"latin":"Iztirobga tushuvchi iztirobga tushgan kunda.","cyrillic":"Изтиробга тушувчи изтиробга тушган кунда."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5718.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5718.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5719,"numberInSurah":7,"text":"تَتْبَعُهَا ٱلرَّادِفَةُ","translation":{"latin":"Unga ergashuvchi ergashganda.","cyrillic":"Унга эргашувчи эргашганда."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5719.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5719.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5720,"numberInSurah":8,"text":"قُلُوبٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ وَاجِفَةٌ","translation":{"latin":"Oʻsha kunda qalblar xavfga toʻladir.","cyrillic":"Ўша кунда қалблар хавфга тўладир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5720.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5720.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5721,"numberInSurah":9,"text":"أَبْصَٰرُهَا خَٰشِعَةٌۭ","translation":{"latin":"Ularning koʻzlari qoʻrqinchga toʻladir.","cyrillic":"Уларнинг кўзлари қўрқинчга тўладир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5721.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5721.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5722,"numberInSurah":10,"text":"يَقُولُونَ أَءِنَّا لَمَرْدُودُونَ فِى ٱلْحَافِرَةِ","translation":{"latin":"Ular: «Biz, albatta, ortga qaytarilamizmi?» – derlar.","cyrillic":"Улар: «Биз, албатта, ортга қайтариламизми?» – дерлар."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5722.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5722.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5723,"numberInSurah":11,"text":"أَءِذَا كُنَّا عِظَٰمًۭا نَّخِرَةًۭ","translation":{"latin":"«Chirigan suyak boʻlganimizdan keyin ham-a?»","cyrillic":"«Чириган суяк бўлганимиздан кейин ҳам-а?»"},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5723.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5723.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5724,"numberInSurah":12,"text":"قَالُوا۟ تِلْكَ إِذًۭا كَرَّةٌ خَاسِرَةٌۭ","translation":{"latin":"Agar shundoq boʻlsa, bu hasratiy qaytish-ku!» – derlar.","cyrillic":"Агар шундоқ бўлса, бу ҳасратий қайтиш-ку!» – дерлар."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5724.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5724.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5725,"numberInSurah":13,"text":"فَإِنَّمَا هِىَ زَجْرَةٌۭ وَٰحِدَةٌۭ","translation":{"latin":"Albatta, u(qiyomat) bir qichqiriqdan boshqa narsa emas.","cyrillic":"Албатта, у(қиёмат) бир қичқириқдан бошқа нарса эмас."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5725.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5725.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5726,"numberInSurah":14,"text":"فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ","translation":{"latin":"Koʻribsizki, ular (qiyomat) maydonida turibdir.","cyrillic":"Кўрибсизки, улар (қиёмат) майдонида турибдир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5726.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5726.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5727,"numberInSurah":15,"text":"هَلْ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ","translation":{"latin":"Senga Musoning xabari keldimi?","cyrillic":"Сенга Мусонинг хабари келдими?"},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5727.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5727.mp3","juz":30,"page":583,"sajda":false},{"number":5728,"numberInSurah":16,"text":"إِذْ نَادَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ بِٱلْوَادِ ٱلْمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى","translation":{"latin":"Qachonki Robbisi unga Muqaddas Tuva vodiysida nido qildi.","cyrillic":"Қачонки Роббиси унга Муқаддас Тува водийсида нидо қилди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5728.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5728.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5729,"numberInSurah":17,"text":"ٱذْهَبْ إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ إِنَّهُۥ طَغَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"«Firʼavn huzuriga bor, albatta, u tugʻyonga ketdi.","cyrillic":"«Фиръавн ҳузурига бор, албатта, у туғёнга кетди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5729.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5729.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5730,"numberInSurah":18,"text":"فَقُلْ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Bas unga ayt: «Senda poklanishga (ragʻbat) bormi?","cyrillic":"Бас унга айт: «Сенда покланишга (рағбат) борми?"},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5730.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5730.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5731,"numberInSurah":19,"text":"وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Va seni Robbingga hidoyat qilsam, shoyadki (undan) qoʻrqsang», degin».","cyrillic":"Ва сени Роббингга ҳидоят қилсам, шоядки (ундан) қўрқсанг», дегин»."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5731.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5731.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5732,"numberInSurah":20,"text":"فَأَرَىٰهُ ٱلْءَايَةَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Va unga ulkan alomatni koʻrsatdi.","cyrillic":"Ва унга улкан аломатни кўрсатди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5732.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5732.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5733,"numberInSurah":21,"text":"فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Ul uni yolgʻonga chiqardi va osiy boʻldi.","cyrillic":"Ул уни ёлғонга чиқарди ва осий бўлди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5733.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5733.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5734,"numberInSurah":22,"text":"ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ يَسْعَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Soʻng ortiga oʻgirilib, tezlab ketdi.","cyrillic":"Сўнг ортига ўгирилиб, тезлаб кетди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5734.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5734.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5735,"numberInSurah":23,"text":"فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Keyin (odamlarni) toʻpladi va nido qildi.","cyrillic":"Кейин (одамларни) тўплади ва нидо қилди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5735.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5735.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5736,"numberInSurah":24,"text":"فَقَالَ أَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Va, men sizlarning eng oliy Robbingizman, dedi.","cyrillic":"Ва, мен сизларнинг энг олий Роббингизман, деди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5736.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5736.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5737,"numberInSurah":25,"text":"فَأَخَذَهُ ٱللَّهُ نَكَالَ ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ وَٱلْأُولَىٰٓ","translation":{"latin":"Bas, Alloh uni avvalgi va oxirgi gunohlari uchun azobga oldi.","cyrillic":"Бас, Аллоҳ уни аввалги ва охирги гуноҳлари учун азобга олди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5737.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5737.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5738,"numberInSurah":26,"text":"إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةًۭ لِّمَن يَخْشَىٰٓ","translation":{"latin":"Albatta, bunda U zotdan qoʻrqqanlar uchun ibrat bordir.","cyrillic":"Албатта, бунда У зотдан қўрққанлар учун ибрат бордир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5738.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5738.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5739,"numberInSurah":27,"text":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَشَدُّ خَلْقًا أَمِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ ۚ بَنَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Sizlarni yaratish qiyinmi yoki U zot bino qilgan osmonnimi?","cyrillic":"Сизларни яратиш қийинми ёки У зот бино қилган осмонними?"},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5739.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5739.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5740,"numberInSurah":28,"text":"رَفَعَ سَمْكَهَا فَسَوَّىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Uning shiftini yuqori koʻtardi va bekami-koʻst, mustahkam qilib qoʻydi.","cyrillic":"Унинг шифтини юқори кўтарди ва беками-кўст, мустаҳкам қилиб қўйди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5740.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5740.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5741,"numberInSurah":29,"text":"وَأَغْطَشَ لَيْلَهَا وَأَخْرَجَ ضُحَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Kechasini qorongʻu va kunduzini yorugʻ qildi.","cyrillic":"Кечасини қоронғу ва кундузини ёруғ қилди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5741.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5741.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5742,"numberInSurah":30,"text":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ دَحَىٰهَآ","translation":{"latin":"Va undan soʻng erni tuxum shaklida qildi.","cyrillic":"Ва ундан сўнг ерни тухум шаклида қилди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5742.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5742.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5743,"numberInSurah":31,"text":"أَخْرَجَ مِنْهَا مَآءَهَا وَمَرْعَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Undan suvni, oʻt-oʻlanlarni chiqardi.","cyrillic":"Ундан сувни, ўт-ўланларни чиқарди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5743.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5743.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5744,"numberInSurah":32,"text":"وَٱلْجِبَالَ أَرْسَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Va togʻlarni sobit qildi.","cyrillic":"Ва тоғларни собит қилди."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5744.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5744.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5745,"numberInSurah":33,"text":"مَتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","translation":{"latin":"Sizlarga va chorvalaringizga manfaat boʻlsin uchun.","cyrillic":"Сизларга ва чорваларингизга манфаат бўлсин учун."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5745.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5745.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5746,"numberInSurah":34,"text":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلطَّآمَّةُ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Vaqtiki katta gʻolib (qiyomat) kelsa.","cyrillic":"Вақтики катта ғолиб (қиёмат) келса."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5746.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5746.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5747,"numberInSurah":35,"text":"يَوْمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَا سَعَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"U kuni inson qilgan ishlarini eslaydir.","cyrillic":"У куни инсон қилган ишларини эслайдир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5747.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5747.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5748,"numberInSurah":36,"text":"وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلْجَحِيمُ لِمَن يَرَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Va jahannam koʻradiganlarga zohir qilinadir.","cyrillic":"Ва жаҳаннам кўрадиганларга зоҳир қилинадир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5748.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5748.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5749,"numberInSurah":37,"text":"فَأَمَّا مَن طَغَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Ammo kimiki tugʻyonga ketgan boʻlsa.","cyrillic":"Аммо кимики туғёнга кетган бўлса."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5749.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5749.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5750,"numberInSurah":38,"text":"وَءَاثَرَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","translation":{"latin":"Va bu dunyo hayotini ustun qoʻygan boʻlsa.","cyrillic":"Ва бу дунё ҳаётини устун қўйган бўлса."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5750.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5750.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5751,"numberInSurah":39,"text":"فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Bas, albatta, Jahiym (unga) oʻrin boʻladir.","cyrillic":"Бас, албатта, Жаҳийм (унга) ўрин бўладир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5751.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5751.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5752,"numberInSurah":40,"text":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ وَنَهَى ٱلنَّفْسَ عَنِ ٱلْهَوَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Va ammo, kim Robbisining maqomidan qoʻrqqan va oʻz nafsini havolanib ketishidan qaytargan boʻlsa...","cyrillic":"Ва аммо, ким Роббисининг мақомидан қўрққан ва ўз нафсини ҳаволаниб кетишидан қайтарган бўлса..."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5752.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5752.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5753,"numberInSurah":41,"text":"فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَنَّةَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","translation":{"latin":"Bas, albatta, jannat (unga) oʻrin boʻladir.","cyrillic":"Бас, албатта, жаннат (унга) ўрин бўладир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5753.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5753.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5754,"numberInSurah":42,"text":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرْسَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Sendan, qiyomat qachon boʻlur, deb soʻrashadir.","cyrillic":"Сендан, қиёмат қачон бўлур, деб сўрашадир."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5754.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5754.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5755,"numberInSurah":43,"text":"فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكْرَىٰهَآ","translation":{"latin":"U(qiyomat)ning zikrini sen qandoq bilarding.","cyrillic":"У(қиёмат)нинг зикрини сен қандоқ билардинг."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5755.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5755.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5756,"numberInSurah":44,"text":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَىٰهَآ","translation":{"latin":"Uning intihosi Robbinggagina xos.","cyrillic":"Унинг интиҳоси Роббинггагина хос."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5756.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5756.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5757,"numberInSurah":45,"text":"إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"Albatta, sen u(qiyomat)dan qoʻrquvchilarga ogohlantiruvchisan, xolos.","cyrillic":"Албатта, сен у(қиёмат)дан қўрқувчиларга огоҳлантирувчисан, холос."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5757.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5757.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false},{"number":5758,"numberInSurah":46,"text":"كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓا۟ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَىٰهَا","translation":{"latin":"U(qiyomat)ni koʻrgan kunlari, xuddi, bu dunyoda bir kecha yoki kunduzdan boshqa turmaganga oʻxsharlar.","cyrillic":"У(қиёмат)ни кўрган кунлари, худди, бу дунёда бир кеча ёки кундуздан бошқа турмаганга ўхшарлар."},"audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5758.mp3","audio64":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5758.mp3","juz":30,"page":584,"sajda":false}]}